<!--
  Monochrome status bar icon for reminders.

  Android tints small icons with its own colour and discards any colour in the
  artwork, so this must be a flat white silhouette on a transparent background.
  It is resolved by name from the `drawable` folder, which is why the launcher
  icon in mipmap-anydpi-v26 cannot be reused here.

  Placeholder artwork: swap the path for the real MaaSathi brand mark, keeping
  the single-colour flat-fill constraint. It has to stay legible at 24dp.
-->
